  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole organism with very broad transversely rectangular low armour and flat square-ended mouth. [\"Skin colour, webbing and soft tissue thickness inferred; skeleton photograph is flattened fossil not exact living height.\", \"Retains four functional crushing teeth in posterior mouth; closed mouth may hide them. Never describe completely toothless.\", \"Feeding modes debated; no invented exposed baleen or external filter apparatus.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 1.0, \"basis\": \"Museum catalogue18663 about1m taxon estimate. Skull figure2cm bar; do not equate different specimens.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole organism with very broad transversely rectangular low armour and flat square-ended mouth. [\"Skin colour, webbing and soft tissue thickness inferred; skeleton photograph is flattened fossil not exact living height.\", \"Retains four functional crushing teeth in posterior mouth; closed mouth may hide them. Never describe completely toothless.\", \"Feeding modes debated; no invented exposed baleen or external filter apparatus.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 1.0, \"basis\": \"Museum catalogue18663 about1m taxon estimate. Skull figure2cm bar; do not equate different specimens.\"}"
  },
